      "korean": "내일 오전까지 부탁드릴게요.",
      "romanization": "naeil ojeonkkaji butakdeurilgeyo.",
      "meaning": "Please have it by tomorrow morning."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "korean": "네, 준비하겠습니다.",
      "romanization": "ne, junbihagetseumnida.",
      "meaning": "Okay, I'll prepare it."
